# {{ m }}

This directory contains a self-contained C++98 wrapper with a C99 execution core. Put your application in `app.cpp`; regenerate the machine files from the DSL when model behavior changes. The generated program has no Python or third-party runtime dependency.

**Generated files:** Use `machine.hpp` and `MachineWrapper` for integration. `machine.c` and `machine.cpp` are generated implementation files. This guide and `README_zh.md` describe the same API. Follow [Quick Start](#quick-start), then [Integration](#integration), [Recovery](#recovery) and [Build](#build).

