## Quick Start

Save this complete program as `app.cpp`. Its setup follows this model’s declarations for parameters, inputs and abstract actions{% if event_ns.items %} and mounts the complete event-check table{% endif %}. {% if model.dynamic_inputs or model.static_inputs %}Values of `1` are demonstration readings/configuration; replace them with values appropriate for this model.{% endif %} Action callbacks print observations; replace their bodies with application work. Initialize once and let your host scheduler call `cycle` repeatedly on the same instance.

