### Functions

Names below are `MachineWrapper` methods; value snapshots are references, callback tables are pointers.

| Entry | Purpose |
| --- | --- |
| `MachineWrapper()` / `MachineWrapper(options)` | Construct with optional cold configuration; check last_error |
| `init(options)` | Cold initialize with optional values |
| `init()` | Cold initialize/reset with DSL defaults |
| `hot_start(state, vars, parameters)` | Restore a complete live checkpoint |
| `hot_start(state, vars)` / `hot_start(state, vars_pointer)` | Complete persistent restoration for models without parameters |
| `set_input_provider(provider, user_data)` | Copy the input callback table; NULL clears it |
| `set_hooks(hooks, user_data)` | Borrow the action table; NULL uninstalls it |
| `cycle()` | Run using installed input readers |
| `cycle_with_inputs(inputs)` | Run with explicit input values |
| `last_inputs()` | Last successful input snapshot; initially NULL |
| `vars()` | Read persistent state |
| `is_ended()` | Test termination |
| `last_cycle_was_delta()` | Test successful no-progress cycle |
| `current_state_id()` | Current state id (may be composite while awaiting initial entry), or invalid sentinel |
| `current_state_path()` | Diagnostic path or NULL after termination |
